- id: '1754214931347'
  alias: (E) [CLIM] Notification de fermeture des fenêtres
  description: Envoie une notification lorsqu'une fenêtre est fermée.
  triggers:
    - entity_id:
        - binary_sensor.contact_fenetre_salon_ikea_contact
        - binary_sensor.contact_fenetre_cuisine_ikea_contact
        - binary_sensor.contact_fenetre_bureau_ikea_contact
        - binary_sensor.contact_fenetre_chambre_ikea_contact
      from: 'on'
      to: 'off'
      trigger: state
  actions:
    - data:
        title: Fermeture en cours
        message: "{% if trigger.entity_id == 'binary_sensor.contact_fenetre_salon_ikea_contact' %} La fenêtre du Salon a été fermée. {% elif trigger.entity_id == 'binary_sensor.contact_fenetre_cuisine_ikea_contact' %} La fenêtre de la Cuisine a été fermée. {% elif trigger.entity_id == 'binary_sensor.contact_fenetre_bureau_ikea_contact' %} La fenêtre du Bureau a été fermée. {% elif trigger.entity_id == 'binary_sensor.contact_fenetre_chambre_ikea_contact' %} La fenêtre de la Chambre a été fermée. {% endif %} {% if states('sensor.nbre_de_fenetres_fermees') == '4' %} Toutes les fenêtres sont maintenant fermées. {% endif %}"
      action: notify.mobile_app_poco_x7_pro
  mode: queued

- id: '1754230309244'
  alias: (F) [ CLIM ] Automatisation qui détecte quand un climatiseur est désactivé et envoie une notification
  description: Automatisation pour détecter quand un climatiseur est désactivé manuellement et envoyer une notification, uniquement si toutes les fenêtres sont fermées.
  triggers:
    - entity_id:
        - climate.clim_salon_rm4_mini
        - climate.clim_bureau_rm4_mini
        - climate.clim_chambre_rm4_mini
      trigger: state
      from:
      to: 'off'
  actions:
    - choose:
        - conditions:
            - condition: and
              conditions:
                - condition: template
                  value_template: '{{ trigger.entity_id == ''climate.clim_salon_rm4_mini'' }}'
                - condition: state
                  entity_id: switch.clim_salon_nous
                  state: 'on'
                - condition: state
                  entity_id: switch.clim_du_bureau_nous
                  state: 'on'
                - condition: state
                  entity_id: switch.clim_chambre_nous
                  state: 'on'
                - condition: state
                  entity_id: binary_sensor.contact_fenetre_salon_ikea_contact
                  state: 'off'
                - condition: state
                  entity_id: binary_sensor.contact_fenetre_cuisine_ikea_contact
                  state: 'off'
                - condition: state
                  entity_id: binary_sensor.contact_fenetre_bureau_ikea_contact
                  state: 'off'
                - condition: state
                  entity_id: binary_sensor.contact_fenetre_chambre_ikea_contact
                  state: 'off'
          sequence:
            - action: notify.mobile_app_poco_x7_pro
              data:
                title: ARRÊT CLIM
                message: La clim. du Salon a été coupée manuellement.
        - conditions:
            - condition: and
              conditions:
                - condition: template
                  value_template: '{{ trigger.entity_id == ''climate.clim_bureau_rm4_mini'' }}'
                - condition: state
                  entity_id: binary_sensor.contact_fenetre_salon_ikea_contact
                  state: 'off'
                - condition: state
                  entity_id: binary_sensor.contact_fenetre_cuisine_ikea_contact
                  state: 'off'
                - condition: state
                  entity_id: binary_sensor.contact_fenetre_bureau_ikea_contact
                  state: 'off'
                - condition: state
                  entity_id: binary_sensor.contact_fenetre_chambre_ikea_contact
                  state: 'off'
          sequence:
            - action: notify.mobile_app_poco_x7_pro
              data:
                title: ARRÊT CLIM
                message: La clim. du Bureau a été coupée manuellement.
        - conditions:
            - condition: and
              conditions:
                - condition: template
                  value_template: '{{ trigger.entity_id == ''climate.clim_chambre_rm4_mini'' }}'
                - condition: state
                  entity_id: binary_sensor.contact_fenetre_salon_ikea_contact
                  state: 'off'
                - condition: state
                  entity_id: binary_sensor.contact_fenetre_cuisine_ikea_contact
                  state: 'off'
                - condition: state
                  entity_id: binary_sensor.contact_fenetre_bureau_ikea_contact
                  state: 'off'
                - condition: state
                  entity_id: binary_sensor.contact_fenetre_chambre_ikea_contact
                  state: 'off'
          sequence:
            - action: notify.mobile_app_poco_x7_pro
              data:
                title: ARRÊT CLIM
                message: La clim. de la Chambre a été coupée manuellement.
  mode: queued
